{"data":[{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-10-04T14:36:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2106755462586880227"],"id":"2106755462586880227","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":2426,"like_count":15,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"碳水决定你拉屎的总量，\n蛋白质决定拉屎的硬度，\n膳食纤维决定拉屎的形状，\n脂肪决定拉屎的顺畅度，\n火龙果决定拉屎的颜色，\n玉米可以加上点缀，\n而金针菇有机会拉出双截棍！\n辣椒则决定你拉屎的感受。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2106755462586880227"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-10-04T14:30:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2106753867241386177"],"id":"2106753867241386177","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":2269,"like_count":14,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"你以为你在交朋友，实际你在接客。\n\n一句“我懂你”，你就敞开情绪的大门。\n一句“我只跟你说”，你就把心事全盘托出。\n\n他们不花钱，不负责，不留任何东西，只把你当成一个随时可进出的情绪泄欲场。\n\n还有跟你搞暧昧的，更是白嫖的高手，他们不给你任何实际的东西。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2106753867241386177"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-10-04T12:31:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2106723996612104306"],"id":"2106723996612104306","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4291,"like_count":9,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2105147143812165646","type":"quoted"}],"text":"这几天还有人不停私信，都认真看下哈，过10000粉才会再开放，而且是纯聊天群，不推票、不荐票，且门槛极高！没过10000粉之前，不要一遍又一遍的发哈！ https://t.co/Br139v2Uo1","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2106723996612104306"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-10-04T00:08:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2106536941340836001"],"id":"2106536941340836001","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2246,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"昨天爬山完，这会醒来臀大肌疼，大半年的康复训练，终于学会了用臀发力，通过臀大肌带动股四头肌，进而保护了膝盖！","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2106536941340836001"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-10-03T15:16:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2106402923383288006"],"id":"21064029233832